ncreases the damage of nearby friendly heroes. Vengeful Spirit herself receives %self_multiplier%%% extra bonus.", "notes_zh": ["破坏会使攻击力光环失效。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "提升自身加成系数。死亡时产生一个复仇之魂的强幻象，继承全额攻击力，可以施放自己的所有技能。复仇之魂复活时若幻象依然存在，则自身会直接将其取代。幻象获得的经验将给予英雄。强幻象不会被相关技能秒杀。", "en": "Increases self multiplier. Upon death, creates a strong illusion of Vengeful Spirit that deals full damage, and can cast all of her spells.If the illusion is alive when Vengeful Spirit respawn, she will take its place. XP earned by her illusion is given to her. Strong Illusions are not instantly killed by spells."}}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["bonus_base_damage", "self_multiplier", "aura_radius", "scepter_illusion_damage_out_pct", "scepter_illusion_damage_in_pct", "scepter_illusion_ms_bonus_pct", "AbilityCastRange"]}, {"subject": "vengefulspirit_retribution", "name_zh": "复仇之魂·恶有恶报", "name_en": "Retribution", "description_zh": "复仇之魂的攻击同时被视为远程和近战，可以获得相应加成。只要敌方英雄击杀了复仇之魂，他们会获得一个负面效果，直到下次阵亡，期间复仇之魂会对他们造成%bonus_damage%%%额外伤害。同一时间只能存在一个负面效果。", "description_en": "Vengeful Spirit is considered both a ranged and a melee attacker to gain the respective bonuses.When killed by an enemy hero, Vengeful Spirit deals %bonus_damage%%% bonus damage to her killer until their next death. Only one debuff can exist at a time.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["bonus_damage"]}, {"subject": "vengefulspirit_nether_swap", "name_zh": "复仇之魂·移形换位", "name_en": "Nether Swap", "description_zh": "与一个目标英雄瞬间交换位置，不论敌我。移形换位会打断目标的持续施法。敌方英雄被交换后受到伤害。复仇之魂和被交换的友方英雄都会获得等同于造成伤害的护盾。", "description_en": "Instantaneously swaps positions with a target Hero, friend or enemy. Nether Swap interrupts channeling abilities on the target. Enemy Swapped units take damage. Vengeful Spirit and allied swapped units gain a barrier equal to the damage dealt.", "notes_zh": ["对减益免疫单位有效。", "技能施放后复仇之魂和目标附近的树木将会被摧毁。", "移形换位能够打断持续施法。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["damage_reduction_duration", "damage", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "windrunner_shackleshot", "name_zh": "风行者·束缚击", "name_en": "Shackleshot", "description_zh": "将目标束缚在正对其后的一个敌方单位或树上。若目标后面没有其它敌方单位或树木，则眩晕时间减少至%fail_stun_duration%秒。", "description_en": "Shackles the target to an enemy unit or tree in a line directly behind it.  If no unit or tree is present, the stun duration is reduced to %fail_stun_duration%.", "notes_zh": ["该技能可以将两个敌人一起束缚，使他们同时眩晕。", "束缚击能将目标束缚在身后最多%shackle_distance%距离的敌方单位或树木。", "束缚击可以被躲避。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["fail_stun_duration", "stun_duration", "shackle_distance", "arrow_speed", "shackle_count", "shackle_angle", "bonus_damage_per_hero", "bonus_damage_per_other_pct", "damage_buff_duration", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "windrunner_powershot", "name_zh": "风行者·强力击", "name_en": "Powershot", "description_zh": "持续施法 - 风行者为她的弓蓄力，射出一支强力的箭矢，最长可蓄力%abilitychanneltime%秒，其间可以打断蓄力，蓄力时间越长，箭矢伤害越高。这支箭会对穿过的所有敌方单位造成伤害和减速效果，并破坏树木。每伤害一个单位，箭矢的伤害和减速效果都会降低。", "description_en": "CHANNELED - Windranger charges her bow for up to %abilitychanneltime% second for a single powerful shot, which deals more damage the longer it is charged. The arrow damages and slows enemies' movement speed along its path. For each enemy that Powershot hits, its damage and slow is reduced.", "notes_zh": ["强力击将摧毁作用范围内的树木。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["powershot_damage", "slow", "slow_duration", "damage_reduction", "arrow_width", "arrow_range", "arrow_speed", "tree_width", "vision_radius", "vision_duration", "min_execute_threshold", "max_execute_threshold", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityChannelTime", "AbilityManaCost"]}, {"subject": "windrunner_windrun", "name_zh": "风行者·风行", "name_en": "Windrun", "description_zh": "提升移动速度，并闪避一切物理攻击。", "description_en": "Increases movement speed and adds evasion from all physical attacks.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["movespeed_bonus_pct", "evasion_pct_tooltip", "AbilityDuration", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "windrunner_gale_force", "name_zh": "风行者·狂风之力", "name_en": "Gale Force", "description_zh": "以矢量为目标。召唤出一阵强风，将目标区域内所有敌人朝目标方向推去。", "description_en": "Vector Targeted. Summons a strong wind that pushes all enemies in the target area towards the target direction.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "shard", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration", "wind_strength", "radius", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "windrunner_focusfire", "name_zh": "风行者·集中火力", "name_en": "Focus Fire", "description_zh": "风行者受风的引领，攻击敌方单位或建筑的攻击速度增加%bonus_attack_speed%，但是攻击力降低。不过次级物品效果的额外伤害不会降低。", "description_en": "Windranger channels the wind to gain %bonus_attack_speed% additional attack speed against a single enemy unit or structure, though with a reduction to her attack damage.  Extra damage from secondary item effects is not reduced.", "notes_zh": ["下达停在原地的指令会暂停风行者的攻击。", "风行者在攻击时可以移动。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["bonus_attack_speed", "attacks_per_second", "focusfire_damage_reduction", "focusfire_fire_on_the_move", "process_procs", "is_unfocused", "cooldown_reduction_per_kill", "bonus_range", "unfocused_cancel_initial_cooldown", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityDuration", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "windrunner_tailwind", "name_zh": "风行者·一路顺风", "name_en": "Tailwind", "description_zh": "施放技能会召唤一阵顺风，向风行者提供短时间的移动速度爆发。移动速度加成在顺风持续时间的半途开始逐渐衰减。\n\n被动提升风行者的移动速度上限。", "description_en": "Using an ability conjures a stacking Tailwind that gives Windranger a brief burst of movement speed. Movement speed bonus gradually starts fading halfway through the Tailwind duration.\n\nPassively increases Windranger's max movement speed.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "攻击也会提供顺风效果。顺风的持续时间更长，并且不可驱散。", "en": "Attacks grant Tailwind. Tailwind lasts longer and is undispellable."}}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["movespeed_bonus", "duration", "max_movespeed", "applies_on_attack", "undispellable"]}, {"subject": "zuus_arc_lightning", "name_zh": "宙斯·弧形闪电", "name_en": "Arc Lightning", "description_zh": "释放一道会跳跃穿越附近敌人的闪电，并造成伤害。", "description_en": "Hurls a bolt of lightning that leaps through nearby enemy units that deal damage.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["arc_damage", "radius", "jump_count", "jump_delay", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "zuus_lightning_bolt", "name_zh": "宙斯·雷击", "name_en": "Lightning Bolt", "description_zh": "召唤一道闪电打击一个敌方单位，造成伤害及短暂眩晕。施放后，雷击在目标周围%sight_radius_night%范围内提供空中视野和真实视域。本技能可以对地施放，将会自动作用于%spread_aoe%范围内最近的敌方英雄上。", "description_en": "Calls down a bolt of lightning to strike an enemy unit, causing damage and a mini-stun. When cast, Lightning Bolt briefly provides unobstructed vision and True Sight around the target in a %sight_radius_night% radius. Can be cast on the ground, affecting the closest enemy hero in %spread_aoe% range.", "notes_zh": ["该技能可以打断持续施法类技能和物品。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["damage", "true_sight_radius", "sight_radius_day", "sight_radius_night", "sight_duration", "spread_aoe", "ministun_duration", "aoe_radius", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "zuus_heavenly_jump", "name_zh": "宙斯·神圣一跳", "name_en": "Heavenly Jump", "description_zh": "宙斯作出神圣一跳，向前跳跃并震击最近的可见敌人（以英雄优先），造成伤害，并减缓其移动速度、攻击速度。宙斯获得附近%vision_radius%范围的顺畅视野，持续3秒。", "description_en": "Zeus performs a Heavenly Jump, leaping forward and shocking the closest visible nearby enemy (prioritizing heroes), dealing damage as well as reducing their movement and attack speed. Zeus gets %vision_radius% unobstructed vision around him for 3 seconds.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["damage", "hop_distance", "hop_duration", "hop_height", "range", "vision_radius", "vision_duration", "duration", "move_slow", "aspd_slow", "targets", "AbilityCharges", "AbilityChargeRestoreTime", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "zuus_cloud", "name_zh": "宙斯·雷云", "name_en": "Nimbus", "description_zh": "在地图任意地点创造一朵雷云，雷云将自动对附近敌人施放雷击。", "description_en": "Creates a storm cloud anywhere on the map that automatically casts Lightning Bolt on nearby enemies.", "notes_zh": ["敌方英雄将其摧毁后可以获得%cloud_bounty_tooltip%金。", "以宙斯当前等级的雷击作用于最近的敌方单位。", "防御塔和非英雄单位对雷云造成半额伤害。"], "granted_by": "scepter", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["cloud_duration", "cloud_bolt_interval", "cloud_radius", "hits_to_kill_tooltip", "creep_hits_to_kill_tooltip", "cloud_bounty_tooltip", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "zuus_lightning_hands", "name_zh": "宙斯·霹雳之手", "name_en": "Lightning Hands", "description_zh": "宙斯获得攻击速度加成，并且他的攻击会产生弧形闪电，造成一定百分比的伤害。可以关闭，使攻击不附带该效果。", "description_en": "Zeus gains bonus attack speed and his attacks create Arc Lightnings that deal a percentage of its damage. Can be toggled off to stop this effect.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "shard", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["attack_speed_bonus", "arc_lightning_damage_pct", "arc_lightning_damage_illusion_pct"]}, {"subject": "zuus_thundergods_wrath", "name_zh": "宙斯·雷神之怒", "name_en": "Thundergod's Wrath", "description_zh": "用闪电打击所有敌方英雄，对他们造成伤害，无论他们身在何处。在打击前提供每个英雄的真实视域。", "description_en": "Strikes all enemy heroes with a bolt of lightning, dealing damage no matter where they may be. Provides True Sight around each hero before they are struck.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["sight_radius_day", "sight_radius_night", "sight_duration", "damage", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "zuus_static_field", "name_zh": "宙斯·静电场", "name_en": "Static Field", "description_zh": "宙斯攻击或通过技能击中敌人都会电击他们，造成他们当前生命值一定百分比的伤害。", "description_en": "Zeus shocks any enemy that he attacks or is hit by his abilities, causing damage equal to a percentage of their current health.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["damage_health_pct"]}, {"subject": "kunkka_torrent", "name_zh": "昆卡·洪流", "name_en": "Torrent", "description_zh": "召唤喷涌的洪流，短暂延迟后，将敌人冲上天，造成伤害、眩晕和减速。", "description_en": "Summons a rising torrent that, after a short delay, hurls enemy units into the sky, stunning, dealing damage and slowing movement speed.", "notes_zh": ["初始泡泡效果仅对队友可见，并且提供战争迷雾中的视野。", "飞到半空的单位将会被眩晕并且可以被攻击。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["radius", "movespeed_bonus", "slow_duration", "stun_duration", "delay", "torrent_damage", "damage_tick_interval", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "kunkka_tidebringer", "name_zh": "昆卡·潮汐使者", "name_en": "Tidebringer", "description_zh": "昆卡的传奇之剑使他的下一次攻击附加额外的攻击力并在前方造成大范围的分裂攻击伤害。", "description_en": "Kunkka's legendary sword grants increased damage and cleaves a large area of effect in front of him for a single strike.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["cleave_starting_width", "cleave_ending_width", "cleave_distance", "damage_bonus", "cleave_damage", "movespeed_slow", "movespeed_slow_duration", "pierces_armor", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCharges", "AbilityChargeRestoreTime", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "kunkka_x_marks_the_spot", "name_zh": "昆卡·X标记", "name_en": "X Marks the Spot", "description_zh": "对友方或敌方英雄使用，用 X 标记他们当前位置，数秒后将他们送回 X 标记处。在技能持续时间内，昆卡可以手动触发送回。对友方英雄使用后持续时间加倍。", "description_en": "Targets a friendly or enemy Hero, marks their position with an X, and returns them to it after several seconds.  Kunkka can trigger the return at any time during the duration. Lasts twice as long on allied heroes.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration", "allied_duration", "fow_range", "fow_duration", "rum_allies_radius", "buff_duration", "movespeed_bonus", "ghostship_absorb", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "kunkka_admirals_rum", "name_zh": "昆卡·统帅朗姆酒", "name_en": "Admiral's Rum", "description_zh": "如果昆卡受到来自敌方英雄、建筑或肉山的伤害会使他的生命低于%damage_threshold%%%临界值，那么他会浸在统帅朗姆酒中，获得移动速度加成，并且延后承受即将受到的%ghostship_absorb%%%伤害，持续%buff_duration%秒。", "description_en": "Damage from enemy heroes, buildings, or Roshan that would reduce Kunkka below %damage_threshold%%% threshold causes him to douse himself with The Admiral's Rum, receiving bonus movement speed and a delayed reaction to %ghostship_absorb%%% of incoming damage for %buff_duration%s.", "notes_zh": ["在朗姆酒效果消失后造成的伤害不能致死，而且不能杀死英雄。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["damage_threshold", "ghostship_absorb", "buff_duration", "movespeed_bonus", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "kunkka_tidal_wave", "name_zh": "昆卡·潮汐波", "name_en": "Tidal Wave", "description_zh": "释放一道在昆卡身后出现的潮汐波。造成点伤害，并将敌人沿着波浪拖拽距离。敌人被拖拽时无法攻击。", "description_en": "Releases a Tidal Wave that spawns behind Kunkka. Deals damage and drags enemies along it. Enemies cannot attack while being dragged.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "shard", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["speed", "radius", "damage", "duration", "wave_distance_tooltip", "knockback_distance", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "kunkka_ghostship", "name_zh": "昆卡·幽灵船", "name_en": "Ghostship", "description_zh": "召唤一艘幽灵船驶过战场，直到撞成粉碎，残骸周围的敌人将会因撞击受到伤害并眩晕。被幽灵船碰到的友军会获得2倍效果的统帅朗姆酒。", "description_en": "Summons a ghostly ship that sails through the battle before smashing apart, damaging and stunning all enemies caught near the wreckage.Allied heroes touched by the Ghostship are given a %rum_factor%x strong swig of The Admiral's Rum.", "notes_zh": ["幽灵船实际的碰撞范围比船本身大。", "幽灵船的移动速度为%ghostship_speed%。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "幽灵船在目标地点以%fleet_interval%秒的间隔产生%fleet_count%艘船组成的舰队。每艘船现在还会从左舷和右舷发射%num_cannon_volleys%波炮弹，穿过敌人时造成%cannon_ball_damage_pct%%%幽灵船伤害。", "en": "Ghostship creates a fleet of %fleet_count% ships at the target point on a %fleet_interval% second interval. Each ship now also fires %num_cannon_volleys% waves of cannonballs from the port and starboard side that deal %cannon_ball_damage_pct%%% of Ghostship's damage as they pass through enemies."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["tooltip_delay", "ghostship_distance", "ghostship_width", "stun_duration", "ghostship_speed", "rum_factor", "fleet_interval", "fleet_count", "fire_cannons", "cannon_ball_damage_pct", "cannon_ball_distance", "cannon_ball_speed", "cannon_count", "cannon_ball_radius", "num_cannon_volleys"]}]
